-shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [prev, curr] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [curr, prev];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev[n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>DP 表格示例（word1=&quot;horse&quot;, word2=&quot;ros&quot;）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"    &quot;&quot;  r  o  s&#10;&quot;&quot;   0  1  2  3&#10;h    1  1  2  3&#10;o    2  2  1  2&#10;r    3  2  2  2&#10;s    4  3  3  2&#10;e    5  4  4  3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>    \"\"  r  o  s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"\"   0  1  2  3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>h    1  1  2  3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>o    2  2  1  2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>r    3  2  2  2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>s    4  3  3  2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>e    5  4  4  3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>答案 <code>dp[5][3] = 3</code>，表示 &quot;horse&quot; → &quot;ros&quot; 需要 3 次操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>标准 DP</th>\n<th>空间优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 填充 (m+1) × (n+1) 的 DP 表格，每个格子 O(1)。m, n ≤ 500 时约 25 万次操作。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 标准 DP 需要完整的二维数组。空间优化版本只保留当前行和上一行，O(min(m, n))。</p>\n<p><strong>编辑距离的扩展应用：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>拼写纠错：</strong> 计算用户输入与词典中每个词的编辑距离，推荐距离最小的词</li>\n<li><strong>DNA 比对：</strong> 两个 DNA 序列的相似度通过编辑距离衡量</li>\n<li><strong>模糊搜索：</strong> 数据库中的近似字符串匹配</li>\n<li><strong>机器翻译评估：</strong> BLEU 分数的变体使用了编辑距离的概念</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本题是面试中最高频的 DP 题之一。掌握此题的关键在于理解三种操作对应的 DP 转移方向，以及正确的初始化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 72 编辑距离","id":"leetcode-72-编辑距离"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 32 最长有效括号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0032-longest-valid-parentheses"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 87 扰乱字符串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0087-scramble-string"}}